        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, head to the Luján de Cuyo wine region with a guide who specialises in the wines of the area.\n\nYou will visit two or three wineries. Options include Salentein, Clos de los Siete, Piedras Negras, Andeluna Cellars and Atamisque. During the visits, you will learn how grapes are grown and harvested and how different wines are made, aged and bottled. Your guide will explain the basics of wine tasting and the role of glassware and cork. The programme ends with lunch at a winery, served with local wines."
    },
